    "about": "Overview Safar Silsila Offers Hazara &amp; Khanpur Tour Package for their beloved clients. If you are looking for comfortable Trip to North Pakistan in one go then you are at right place. We have a Various range of trekking tours in north Pakistan . People who are looking for adventurous tours then these Tour Package are recommended. Hazara &amp; Khanpur Tour (Day Trip from Islamabad) – 01 Day Hazara &amp; Khanpur Trip is another sightseeing option if you are in Islamabad for multiple days and if you have interest in nature and landscapes. The Buddhist heritage of Hazara is a significant draw for history enthusiasts and archaeology aficionados. The region boasts an array of Gandhara-era archaeological sites, including the notable Shingardar Stupa. This ancient structure, with its intricate carvings and historical significance, provides a glimpse into the artistic mastery of the time. On the other hand, Khanpur is a testament to the unspoiled beauty of nature. Nestled around the serene Khanpur Lake, this region is a haven for those seeking respite from the hustle and bustle of urban life. The lake, formed by the Khanpur Dam on the Haro River, offers a tranquil setting for boating, fishing, and picnicking against the backdrop of the Margalla Hills. Dates &amp; Cost – Hazara &amp; Khanpur Tour (1 Day) All seasons are considered good for Hazara &amp; Khanpur Tour Considering the inflow of tourists all year around, our dates are open throughout the year and your bookings will be 100% guaranteed even if you are a single traveler. Our prices and dates for Hazara &amp; Khanpur Tour (all season) are given below. Package Price: Season Month Tour Start Date Price Per Person USD Minimum Travelers Required Spring Mid November &#8211; February Daily USD 79 1 Pax Winter March &#8211; May Daily USD 99 1 Pax Summer June &#8211; Mid September Daily USD 120 1 Pax Autumn Mid September &#8211; November Daily USD 79 1 Pax FOR BOOKINGS &amp; INQURIES: EMAIL: info@safarsilsila.pk WHATSAPP: +92 311 1145456 Follow us on Instagram: Safar Silsila Also Recommended: Panjpeer Rocks Tour (Day Trip from Islamabad",
