    "about": "Overview The Peshawar City Tour will take you on a fascinating excursion through one of Pakistan’s oldest and most culturally diverse cities. Explore ancient landmarks, colorful bazaars, and the distinct blend of history, culture, and local handicrafts that defines Peshawar’s everlasting appeal. Why Visit peshawar? Peshawar, the capital city of Khyber Pakhtunkhwa in Pakistan, is a fascinating destination to visit for its rich cultural history, vibrant markets, and warm hospitality. Historical Significance : Peshawar is one of the oldest cities in the region, with a history that spans over 2,000 years. It has witnessed the rise and fall of various civilizations, from the Gandhara period to the Mughal era, which is reflected in its architecture and archaeological sites. Dates &amp; Cost All seasons are considered good for the Peshawar City Tour. Considering the inflow of tourists all year round, our dates are open throughout the year and your bookings will be 100% guaranteed even if you are a single traveler. Our prices and dates for the Peshawar City Trip (all seasons) are given below. Package Price: Season Month Tour Start Date Price Per Person USD Minimum Travelers Required Spring Mid November &#8211; February 2025 Daily USD 208 1 Pax Winter March &#8211; May 2025 Daily USD 208 1 Pax Summer June &#8211; Mid September 2025 Daily USD 208 1 Pax Autumn Mid September &#8211; November 2025 Daily USD 208 1 Pax FOR BOOKINGS &amp; INQURIES: EMAIL: info@safarsilsila.pk WHATSAPP: +92 311 1145456 Follow us on Instagram Safar Silsila Also Recommended: Gujranwala City Tour",
