    "about": "Overview Changa Manga and Head Balloki Tour Changa Manga and Head Balloki Tour uniquely combine nature and history. Changa Manga is a historic man-made forest and wildlife sanctuary, and Head Balloki on the Ravi River is an important irrigation location. Both locations offer a tranquil escape ideal for nature lovers and history enthusiasts alike. why visit Changa Manga and Head Balloki ? Changa Manga and Head Balloki offers a blend of natural beauty, outdoor activities, and a chance to explore the peaceful, scenic landscapes outside of the hustle and bustle of Pakistan&#8217;s major cities. Changa Manga is one of the largest man-made forests in the world, located about 70 kilometers from Lahore in Punjab, Pakistan. Dates &amp; Cost – Changa Manga and Head Balloki Tour All seasons are considered good for the Changa Manga and Head Balloki Trip. Considering the inflow of tourists all year round, our dates are open throughout the year and your bookings will be 100% guaranteed even if you are a single traveler. Our prices and dates for the Changa Manga and Head Balloki Trip (all seasons) are given below. Package Price: Season Month Tour Start Date Price Per Person USD Minimum Travelers Required Spring Mid November &#8211; February Daily USD 120 1 Pax Winter March &#8211; May Daily USD 120 1 Pax Summer June &#8211; Mid September Daily USD 120 1 Pax Autumn Mid September &#8211; November Daily USD 120 1 Pax FOR BOOKINGS &amp; INQURIES: EMAIL: info@safarsilsila.pk WHATSAPP: +92 311 1145456 Follow us on Instagram: Safar Silsila Also Recommended: Sialkot City Tour",
