    "about": "Overview Taxila Tour Explore the ancient wonders on our Taxila Tour, a UNESCO World Heritage Site located just outside of Islamabad. This engaging journey takes in breathtaking ruins like the Dharmarajika Stupa as well as the thriving towns of Sirkap and Jaulian. Discover Taxila’s rich past as a hub of study and culture, where many civilizations thrived along historic trade paths. Immerse yourself in interesting stories from the past on this must-see excursion for history buffs. About Taxila Taxila is an ancient city located in the Punjab province of Pakistan, about 30 kilometers northwest of Islamabad. It holds a rich historical and archaeological significance, dating back over 2,000 years. Once a center of learning, culture, and religion, Taxila was part of the Gandhara region, which was known for its influence on Buddhist culture and civilization. Dates &amp; Cost – Taxila Tour All seasons are considered good for the Taxila Trip. Considering the inflow of tourists all year round, our dates are open throughout the year and your bookings will be 100% guaranteed even if you are a single traveler. Our prices and dates for this tour (all seasons) are given below. package Price: Season Month Tour Start Date Price Per Person USD Minimum Travelers Required Spring Mid November &#8211; February Daily USD 105 1 Pax Winter March &#8211; May Daily USD 105 1 Pax Summer June &#8211; Mid September Daily USD 105 1 Pax Autumn Mid September &#8211; November Daily USD 105 1 Pax FOR BOOKINGS &amp; INQURIES: EMAIL: info@safarsilsila.pk WHATSAPP: +92 311 1145456 Follow us on Instagram: Safar Silsila Also Recommended: Katora Lake Trek",
