    "originalPrice": "Contact for Quote",
    "departureDay": "Daily Departures & Fixed Schedules",
    "about": "Overview Bolan Pass Train Tour The Bolan Pass Train Tour is a thrilling ride across one of Pakistan’s most beautiful mountain crossings in Balochistan. This excursion, which covers around 55 kilometers, provides spectacular scenery of rocky mountains and tiny gorges that highlight the area’s natural splendor. Participants can see historical monuments like relics of colonial railways and ancient forts, as well as interact with local Brahui and Baloch people. Trekking and jeep safaris are common activities on vacation, giving a unique blend of adventure and cultural immersion that showcases the region’s rich legacy. Dates &amp; Cost – Bolan Pass Train Tour All seasons are considered good for the Bolan Pass Train Trip. Considering the inflow of tourists all year round, our dates are open throughout the year and your bookings will be 100% guaranteed even if you are a single traveler. Our prices and dates for this tour (all seasons) are given below. Package Price: Season Month Tour Start Date Price Per Person USD Minimum Travelers Required Spring Mid November &#8211; February Daily USD 430 1 Pax Winter March &#8211; May Daily USD 430 1 Pax Summer June &#8211; Mid September Daily USD 430 1 Pax Autumn Mid September &#8211; November Daily USD 430 1 Pax FOR BOOKINGS &amp; INQURIES: EMAIL: info@safarsilsila.pk WHATSAPP: +92 311 1145456 Follow us on Instagram: Safar Silsila Also Recommended: Kalar Kahar Tour",
