    "about": "Overview Makran Coastal Highway Tour (2024-25) Take a memorable trip along the Makran Coastal Highway, where breathtaking scenery meets a rich cultural legacy. This historic path runs along the Arabian Sea from Karachi to Gwadar, providing breathtaking vistas of craggy cliffs, gorgeous beaches, and thriving local towns. Explore historical places, enjoy wonderful local cuisine, and immerse yourself in Balochistan’s natural beauty. Whether you’re a nature lover or a history buff, the Makran Coastal Highway Tour offers an immersive travel experience unlike any other. Dates &amp; Cost – Makran Coastal Highway Tour All seasons are considered good for the Makran Coastal Highway Trip . Considering the inflow of tourists all year round, our dates are open throughout the year and your bookings will be 100% guaranteed even if you are a single traveler. Our prices and dates for this tour (all seasons) are given below. Package Price: Season Month Tour Start Date Price Per Person USD Minimum Travelers Required Spring Mid November &#8211; February 2025 Daily USD 1150 1 Pax Winter March &#8211; May 2025 Daily USD 1150 1 Pax Summer June &#8211; Mid September 2025 Daily USD 1150 1 Pax Autumn Mid September &#8211; November 2025 Daily USD 1150 1 Pax FOR BOOKINGS &amp; INQURIES: EMAIL: info@safarsilsila.pk WHATSAPP: +92 311 1145456 Follow us on Instagram: Safar Silsila Also Recommended: Mangla Dam Tour",
