    "about": "Overview Gurdwara Panja Sahib Tour: Gurdwara Panja Sahib Tour is a good option if you are in Islamabad for multiple days and if you have interest in culture, history and heritage of Pakistan’s Sikh community. The history of Gurdwara Panja Sahib traces back to the time of Guru Nanak Dev Ji, the founder of Sikhism. According to Sikh tradition, Guru Nanak visited Hasan Abdal during his travels through the region. The site became notable due to a miraculous event—the Guru’s imprint, or “panja” (handprint), was embedded in a boulder. This geological anomaly, believed to be the Guru’s blessing, laid the foundation for Gurdwara Panja Sahib. Dates &amp; Cost – Gurdwara Panja Sahib Tour (1 Day) All seasons are considered good for Gurdwara Panja Sahib Trip. Considering the inflow of tourists all year around, our dates are open throughout the year and your bookings will be 100% guaranteed even if you are a single traveler. Our prices and dates for Gurdwara Panja Sahib Trip (all season) are given below. Package Price: Season Month Tour Start Date Price Per Person USD Minimum Travelers Required Spring Mid November &#8211; February Daily USD 99 1 Pax Winter March &#8211; May Daily USD 109 1 Pax Summer June &#8211; Mid September Daily USD 129 1 Pax Autumn Mid September &#8211; November Daily USD 119 1 Pax FOR BOOKINGS &amp; INQURIES: EMAIL: info@safarsilsila.pk WHATSAPP: +92 311 1145456 Follow us on Instagram: Safar Silsila Also Recommended: Ayubia &amp; Nathia Gali Tour (Day Trip from Islamabad) – 01 Day",
