    "originalPrice": "Contact for Quote",
    "departureDay": "Daily Departures & Fixed Schedules",
    "about": "Overview Katas Raj &amp; Kallar Kahar Tour – 1 Day Discover the rich history and serene beauty of Katas Raj and Kallar Kahar with our one-day tour. This journey is ideal for culture enthusiasts and history lovers visiting Islamabad. Dive into the spiritual and historical significance of the Katas Raj Temples and enjoy the tranquil charm of Kallar Kahar Lake . Highlights of the Tour Katas Raj Temples: Explore this ancient Hindu temple complex near Chakwal, dating back to the Mahabharata era . The temples, centered around a sacred pond believed to be formed from Lord Shiva’s tears, boast intricate carvings, stunning architecture, and a spiritual ambiance. Kallar Kahar Lake: Relax by this beautiful saltwater lake formed from natural springs. Surrounded by hills and reflecting the clear blue sky, Kallar Kahar offers a tranquil retreat. Visit the Takht-e-Babri , a Mughal garden complex that showcases the architectural brilliance of the Mughal era. Why Choose This Tour? Perfect for history and culture enthusiasts. A chance to explore two iconic landmarks in one day. Enjoy both spiritual discovery and scenic beauty. Dates &amp; Cost – Katas Raj &amp; Kallar Kahar Tour (1 Day) This tour is available year-round , ensuring a perfect experience regardless of the season. Even if you’re traveling alone, we guarantee 100% confirmed bookings. Season Month Tour Start Date Price Per Person USD Minimum Travelers Required Spring Mid November &#8211; February Daily USD 109 1 Pax Winter March &#8211; May Daily USD 119 1 Pax Summer June &#8211; Mid September Daily USD 149 1 Pax Autumn Mid September &#8211; November Daily USD 139 1 Pax Book Your Day Tour Now! Don’t miss this opportunity to immerse yourself in the history and beauty of Katas Raj and Kallar Kahar . Reserve your spot today and enjoy a seamless, one-day adventure! &nbsp; &nbsp; Also Recommended: Ghizer Valley Tour Follow us on Instagram: Safar Silsila",
