    "about": "Overview Romantic 3-Day Honeymoon in Hunza – By Air Escape to Hunza Valley with a 3-day honeymoon package by air , designed for couples seeking breathtaking landscapes, luxury, and intimate moments. This trip blends serene beauty, rich culture, and adventure , creating a perfect getaway for newlyweds. Why Choose Hunza for Your Honeymoon? Nestled in the majestic Karakoram Mountains , Hunza offers stunning lake views, cozy resorts, and enchanting sunsets . Whether it’s a romantic boat ride on Attabad Lake or a candlelit dinner with a mountain backdrop , every moment here is unforgettable. 3-Day Honeymoon in Hunza Highlights Scenic Flight to Gilgit – Enjoy breathtaking aerial views of the Karakoram peaks . Luxury Stay with a Romantic Setup – Stay in handpicked resorts offering premium comfort . Attabad Lake Cruise – Experience a peaceful boat ride on turquoise waters . Eagle’s Nest Sunrise – Witness one of the most romantic sunrise views in Pakistan . Baltit &amp; Altit Forts – Explore centuries-old heritage and royal love stories . Package Details Duration: 3 Days / 2 Nights Flight: Islamabad/Lahore/Karachi to Gilgit (PIA/Air Blue) Transport: Private Car/Jeep in Hunza Book Your Dream 3-Day Honeymoon in Hunza Today! This 3-day Hunza honeymoon by air is available all year. Reserve your romantic escape now and create memories that last a lifetime! VEHICLE Standard (Per Couple) Deluxe (Per Couple) Executive (Per Couple) SEDAN CAR PKR 85,000/- PKR 110,000/- PKR 130,000/- JEEP (4*4) PKR 95,000/- PKR 120,000/- PKR 140,000/- NOTE: AIR FARES are not included in the Package. They will be charged separately according to the dates chose by clients. HOTEL DETAILS: We are offering following Hotels for our by Air Honeymoon Package to Hunza Valley. Clients can choose the trip according to their budget. All the Hotels are neat and clean and have the services up to the mark. &nbsp; Cities Standard Deluxe Executive Hunza Hunza Hidden Palace Northern Sapphire Luxus Hunza NOTE: Hotels can be change according to availability. For Booking and Inquries: Whatsapp: +92 311 1145456 Email: info@safarsilsila.pk Follow us on Instagram: Safar Silsila Also Recommended: 4 Days By Air Honeymoon Package for Hunza",
