    "about": "Overview Safar Silsila Offers Ghilam Harish Treka Package for their beloved clients. If you are looking for comfortable Trip to North Pakistan in one go then you are at right place. We have a Various range of trekking tours in north Pakistan . People who are looking for adventurous tours then these Tour Package are recommended. Ghilam Harish Trek The Ghilam Harish Trek is a hidden jewel tucked in the picturesque Yasin Valley of Gilgit-Baltistan, where travelers can discover brilliant, multi-colored rock formations and breathtaking alpine scenery. At an elevation of 4,360 meters, this hike takes you past lush meadows and orchards before arriving at the bizarre Ghilam Harish, also known as Chopor Haresh. The trek, with its unique geological features and panoramic mountain vistas, is an ideal journey for nature lovers and trekking enthusiasts looking to discover one of Pakistan’s most enchanting and pristine regions. Dates &amp; Cost All seasons are considered good for the Ghilam Harish Trak. Considering the inflow of tourists all year round, our dates are open throughout the year and your bookings will be 100% guaranteed even if you are a single traveler. Our prices and dates for this tour (all seasons) are given below.",
