    "originalPrice": "Contact for Quote",
    "departureDay": "Daily Departures & Fixed Schedules",
    "about": "Overview Qaqlasht Festival Tour Join us for the Qaqlasht Festival Tour, where you may attend the exciting Jashan-e-Qaqlasht Festival on the picturesque Qaqlasht Plateau near Chitral. This one-of-a-kind celebration, similar to the Shandur Polo celebration, includes exciting events and lovely scenery. Visit in the early spring to enjoy a stunning meadow of yellow flowers while also experiencing the beauty of one of Chitral’s most secluded and gorgeous locations. About Qaqlasht Festival The Qaqlasht Festival is one of the most vibrant and culturally significant festivals in Balochistan , held annually in the beautiful Qaqlasht Valley , which is located near Ziarat in northern Balochistan . The festival is a celebration of Balochi culture , traditions , and the region&#8217;s natural beauty, drawing locals and tourists alike to witness the festivities. This festival is not only a feast for the eyes but also offers a unique opportunity to experience the rich cultural heritage of the Baloch people, their music, dance, cuisine, and more. Dates &amp; Cost – Qaqlasht Festival Tour All seasons are considered good for the Qaqlasht Festival Tour. Considering the inflow of tourists all year round, our dates are open throughout the year and your bookings will be 100% guaranteed even if you are a single traveler. Our prices and dates for this tour (all seasons) are given below Package Price: Season Month Tour Start Date Price Per Person USD Minimum Travelers Required Spring Mid November &#8211; February Daily USD 740 1 Pax Winter March &#8211; May Daily USD 740 1 Pax Summer June &#8211; Mid September Daily USD 740 1 Pax Autumn Mid September &#8211; November Daily USD 740 1 Pax FOR BOOKINGS &amp; INQURIES: EMAIL: info@safarsilsila.pk WHATSAPP: +92 311 1145456 Follow us on Instagram: Safar Silsila Also Recommended: Sharan Forest Tour",
