    "about": "Overview Katora Lake Trek Enjoy the lovely Katora Lake Trek in the Upper Dir District, Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, Pakistan. This picturesque route takes you through the green Kumrat Valley and the peaceful Jahaz Banda, ending with the breathtaking Katora Lake. Surrounded by beautiful peaks, this glacial lake provides breathtaking views and a peaceful retreat into nature. This trek is ideal for adventurers and environment lovers, offering amazing experiences and breathtaking scenery. About Katora Lake Trek The Katora Lake Trak is one of the most popular and breathtaking treks near Islamabad, located in the beautiful Kaghan Valley in the Khyber Pakhtunkhwa province of Pakistan. The lake itself is situated at a high altitude of around 4,200 meters (13,780 feet) above sea level, making it a challenging yet incredibly rewarding trek for avid hikers and nature enthusiasts. Dates &amp; Cost All seasons are considered good for the Katora Lake Trek. Considering the inflow of tourists all year round, our dates are open throughout the year and your bookings will be 100% guaranteed even if you are a single traveler. Our prices and dates for this tour (all seasons) are given below. Package Price: Season Month Tour Start Date Price Per Person USD Minimum Travelers Required Spring Mid November &#8211; February Daily USD 440 1 Pax Winter March &#8211; May Daily USD 440 1 Pax Summer June &#8211; Mid September Daily USD 440 1 Pax Autumn Mid September &#8211; November Daily USD 440 1 Pax FOR BOOKINGS &amp; INQURIES: EMAIL: info@safarsilsila.pk WHATSAPP: +92 311 1145456 Follow us on Instagram: Safar Silsila Also Recommended: Badgoi Top Dasht Laila Tour",
