    "departureDay": "Daily Departures & Fixed Schedules",
    "about": "Overview Siran Valley Tour Discover the lovely Siran Valley Tour, located in the Hazara region of Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, Pakistan. This hidden gem, located just a short drive from Mansehra, features beautiful green landscapes, calm pine forests, and the serene flow of the Siran River. The valley is ideal for nature enthusiasts, with gorgeous places such as Manda Gucha, Saryala Juchha Meadows, and Adhore Meadows, all of which offer stunning vistas and outdoor activities. Immerse yourself in the rich culture of the region while enjoying the warm hospitality of the surrounding communities. Whether you want action or relaxation, the tour offers a refreshing getaway into nature’s grandeur. Dates &amp; Cost – Siran Valley Tour All seasons are considered good for the Siran Valley Tour. Considering the inflow of tourists all year round, our dates are open throughout the year and your bookings will be 100% guaranteed even if you are a single traveler. Our prices and dates for this tour (all seasons) are given below. Package Price: Season Month Tour Start Date Price Per Person USD Minimum Travelers Required Spring Mid November &#8211; February 2025 Daily USD 440 1 Pax Winter March &#8211; May 2025 Daily USD 440 1 Pax Summer June &#8211; Mid September 2025 Daily USD 440 1 Pax Autumn Mid September &#8211; November 2025 Daily USD 440 1 Pax FOR BOOKINGS &amp; INQURIES: EMAIL: info@safarsilsila.pk WHATSAPP: +92 311 1145456 Follow us on Instagram: Safar Silsila Also Recommended: Soon Valley Tour",
