    "about": "Overview Safar Silsila Offers Tour of the Darel and Tangir Valley Package for their beloved clients. If you are looking for comfortable Trip to North Pakistan in one go then you are at right place. We have a Various range of trekking tours in north Pakistan . People who are looking for adventurous tours then these Tour Package are recommended. Tour of the Darel and Tangir Valley (2024–25) Welcome to Gilgit-Baltistan&#8217;s Darel &amp; Tangir Valley Tour, where you will find stunning landscapes and a wealth of cultural heritage. Explore the vibrant local communities, the ancient Darel Valley ruins, and the serene Tangir River. Our trips offer a special fusion of adventure and cultural learning, guaranteeing lifelong experiences in this stunning destination. The Darel and Tangir Valley Tour&#8217;s (dates and price) The Darel and Tangir Valley Trip is thought to be suitable in all seasons. Our dates are available all year round due to the constant influx of travelers, and even if you are traveling alone, your reservation will be 100% guaranteed. Below are our rates and available dates for this tour (during all seasons). Package Price: Season Month Tour Start Date Price Per Person USD Minimum Travelers Required Spring Mid November &#8211; February 2025 Daily USD 520 1 Pax Winter March &#8211; May 2025 Daily USD 520 1 Pax Summer June &#8211; Mid September 2025 Daily USD 520 1 Pax Autumn Mid September &#8211; November 2025 Daily USD 520 1 Pax FOR BOOKINGS &amp; INQURIES: EMAIL: info@safarsilsila.pk WHATSAPP: +92 311 1145456 Follow us on Instagram: Safar Silsila Also Recommended: Old Silk Road Hunza Tour",
